-- A call script for examples/contract.lang (kit slice K3b).
-- Each call is CALLER NAME ARGS. This script has an ok call, a
-- revert, a trap, a view and an event.
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb deposit 5u
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb withdraw 9u

-- held is 5u, so this deposit overflows u256Add: a trap, as a revert.
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb deposit 0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffu
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb withdraw 2u
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb balance
0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb stamp
